{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22328","headline":"别舍弟後月夜 · 白居易","name":"别舍弟後月夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悄悄初别夜，去住两盘桓。\n行子孤灯店，居人明月轩。\n平生共贫苦，未必日成欢。\n及此暂爲别，怀抱已忧烦。\n况是庭叶尽，复思山路寒。\n如何爲不念，马瘦衣裳单。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}